# One line ending in the index, always LF.
#
# Without this the repo mixed CRLF and LF with no rule: measured 2026-08-25,
# 13 of the 15 files a routine `git status` reported as modified had ZERO
# content change -- 1,476 lines of pure line-ending churn that buried every
# real diff. `eol=lf` also normalises the working tree, so a checkout on
# Windows and one on WSL produce the same bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise binary payloads.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
